(7166077, 1100754, 58667, '<td valign="top">Excellent edit, and I like the expression you took now because it tells the story perfectly (compliments your expression then). Great humour and story.</td>', 'Excellent edit, and I like the expression you took now because it tells the story perfectly (compliments your expression then). Great humour and story.', '2014-01-31 03:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
