(7170674, 1100754, 25355, '<td valign="top">You weren''t supposed to put Riley in the photo.<br/> <br/>Coming back to this, I think whoever took the original photo (your father?) was a pretty talented photographer too. <b>OR</b> you were just a great natural model who wasn''t put off by a pudgy bald guy sitting next to him. ;-Þ</td>', 'You weren''t supposed to put Riley in the photo. Coming back to this, I think whoever took the original photo (your father?) was a pretty talented photographer too. OR you were just a great natural model who wasn''t put off by a pudgy bald guy sitting next to him. ;-Þ', '2014-02-06 03:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170676, 1100638, 25355, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up. Good job, really!</td>', 'Bumping this up. Good job, really!', '2014-02-06 03:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170677, 1100760, 25355, '<td valign="top">Looks very girlish. Though when my niece was little and saw some photos of my father (her grandfather) as a very young boy, she asked him, "Did you use to be a girl?" (Because he had long hair as a young ''un but went bald in in his twenties.)</td>', 'Looks very girlish. Though when my niece was little and saw some photos of my father (her grandfather) as a very young boy, she asked him, "Did you use to be a girl?" (Because he had long hair as a young ''un but went bald in in his twenties.)', '2014-02-06 03:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170678, 1100307, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but with your older self I think you should have tried to match the blurriness/graininess of the original photo.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but with your older self I think you should have tried to match the blurriness/graininess of the original photo.', '2014-02-06 03:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170679, 1100173, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if you placed your head over your mother''s.</td>', 'I''m wondering if you placed your head over your mother''s.', '2014-02-06 03:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170680, 1100774, 25355, '<td valign="top">This seems very Victorian, if you know what I mean. The hand on the shoulder might have been done a little better, though, but good (slightly freaky) job.</td>', 'This seems very Victorian, if you know what I mean. The hand on the shoulder might have been done a little better, though, but good (slightly freaky) job.', '2014-02-06 03:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170681, 1100824, 25355, '<td valign="top">You did very well blending into the original.</td>', 'You did very well blending into the original.', '2014-02-06 03:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170687, 1100754, 30364, '<td valign="top">By far the best of the literal takes.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'By far the best of the literal takes.  8.  Thank you.', '2014-02-06 04:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7170689, 1100660, 30364, '<td valign="top">Sophisticated concept, beautifully realised.  The ages flow back and forth.  Top three.  9.  Thank you.</td>', 'Sophisticated concept, beautifully realised.  The ages flow back and forth.  Top three.  9.  Thank you.', '2014-02-06 04:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
